OL,3,GNEWSAOwner hits back after manager
OL,4,Aresigns over fan abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a non-league football club
OL,7,Fhas hit back at "abusive" fans whose
OL,8,Fbehaviour prompted the team's manager
OL,9,Fto resign.
OL,11,FMatlock Town manager Lewis Duckmanton
OL,12,Fstood down after players and staff
OL,13,Ffaced "direct abuse and threats of
OL,14,Fviolence" from supporters following
OL,15,FSaturday's 4-2 home defeat to
OL,16,FBridlington Town.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
