OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAOwner hits back after manager
OL,4,Aresigns over fan abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub chairman David Hilton said letters
OL,7,Fhad since been sent to "so-called
OL,8,Fsupporters, already on local pub watch
OL,9,Flists and banned from town
OL,10,Festablishments", confirming their
OL,11,Fimmediate bans from the football club.
OL,13,FHilton said the behaviour, including
OL,14,Ffans stealing players' food after the
OL,15,Fmatch, had left a "sour taste" and led
OL,16,Fto him "actively seeking" offers to
OL,17,Fsell the club.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
